# Day 1 Business Insights

## Dataset Summary

- Total Customers: 100,000
- Churned Customers: 33,144
- Overall Churn Rate: 33.14%

---

## Data Validation Summary

Completed the following checks:

- Verified total records
- Checked duplicate Customer IDs
- Checked NULL values
- Validated categorical values
- Analysed numerical columns
- Identified negative TotalCharges values

---

## Key Business Insights

- Approximately one out of every three customers has churned.
- Customer retention should be a primary business focus.
- Further analysis will identify which customer segments contribute most to churn.

---

## Recommendations

- Analyse churn by contract type.
- Analyse churn by payment method.
- Analyse churn by tenure.
- Analyse churn by age group.
- Build machine learning models to predict customer churn risk.
